eading text-[18px] font-semibold leading-[27px] tracking-[-0.0648px] text-navy","children":"1. Assess Your Room's Primary Function"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-[23px] text-[16px] leading-[23px] text-navy","children":[["$","p","The purpose of each room should drive yo",{"children":"The purpose of each room should drive your blind selection. A bedroom prioritizes blackout capability and privacy, while a living room may favor filtered natural light and aesthetic appeal."}],["$","p","Kitchens and bathrooms need moisture-res",{"children":"Kitchens and bathrooms need moisture-resistant materials that can handle steam and splashes. Home offices benefit from blinds that reduce glare on screens while maintaining comfortable ambient light levels."}],["$","p","Consider how you use the room throughout",{"children":"Consider how you use the room throughout the day. A south-facing family room might need adjustable blinds that can handle intense afternoon sun, while a north-facing study may need treatments that maximize the softer light available."}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"flex flex-col items-start","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-[18px] font-semibold leading-[27px] tracking-[-0.0648px] text-navy","children":"2. Material Matters"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-[23px] text-[16px] leading-[23px] text-navy","children":[["$","p","Your choice of material affects durabili",{"children":"Your choice of material affects durability, maintenance, appearance, and cost. Real wood blinds offer warmth and natural beauty but are susceptible to humidity damage — a critical consideration in Florida."}],["$","p","Faux wood provides a similar aesthetic w",{"children":"Faux wood provides a similar aesthetic with significantly better moisture resistance, making it the most popular choice for Florida homes. Aluminum blinds are lightweight, affordable, and ideal for contemporary spaces or high-humidity areas."}],"$L3"]}]]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6"]}]]}]]}]]}],null,"$L7"]}],"isPartial":"$@8","staleTime":"$9","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$La","isPartial":"$@b","staleTime":"$9","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Lc","isPartial":"$@d","staleTime":"$9","varyParams":"$e"},{"rsc":"$Lf","isPartial":"$@10","staleTime":"$9","varyParams":"$e"}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@11","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@12"}
